			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add OutputChannelReplace notification module\n\nIntroduce a new gRPC notification handler for output channel replacement operations in the Vine protocol. The module declaration is added to Source/Server/Notification/mod.rs alongside existing output channel handlers (OutputChannelCoalesce, OutputChannelHide, OutputReplace).\n\nThis extends the server-side notification surface to support replacing output channel content, complementing the existing coalesce and hide operations for extension host output management.",
