				2513,
				29
			],
			"Message": "style(Vine): Remove blank lines after function signatures in all notification handlers\n\nEliminate the superfluous blank line between function signatures and their bodies across the entire Vine gRPC notification layer. This affects 1 client publisher (PublishNotificationFromMux) and 27 server notification handlers in Source/Server/Notification/, covering extension lifecycle, output channels, progress reporting, tree views, provider unregistrations, webview readiness, window commands, and workspace edits.\n\nThe change establishes consistent formatting where the opening brace follows the signature directly, improving vertical density and readability without altering any runtime behavior.",
			"SHA": "22892d5aea7ed4ba292b618026ac680b7e480e0b"
		}
	],
